WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:05.522 --> 00:00:08.402
(epic theme playing)

2
00:00:08.498 --> 00:00:11.186
♪ ♪

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

4
00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.243
♪ ♪

5
00:01:24.393 --> 00:01:32.393
<font color="#ec14bd">Sync & corrections by honey bunny
www.addic7ed.com</font>

6
00:01:44.043 --> 00:01:45.899
(light music playing)

7
00:01:45.923 --> 00:01:48.643
(wind blowing)

8
00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:12.639
♪ ♪

9
00:02:22.087 --> 00:02:23.936
Princess Rhaenyra: There you are.

10
00:02:33.277 --> 00:02:36.124
The Sea Snake is going to die. isn't he?

11
00:02:38.296 --> 00:02:41.239
- Luke...
- I can't be Lord of the Tides.

12
00:02:42.203 --> 00:02:44.413
Grand sire was the greatest
sailor who ever lived.

13
00:02:44.528 --> 00:02:46.432
I get green sick before the ship

14
00:02:46.528 --> 00:02:47.927
even leaves the harbor.

15
00:02:47.928 --> 00:02:49.721
I'll just ruin everything.

16
00:02:50.586 --> 00:02:52.839
I don't want Driftmark.

17
00:02:53.769 --> 00:02:55.218
It should've passed on to Ser Vaemond.

18
00:02:55.243 --> 00:02:58.315
We don't choose our destiny. Luke.
It chooses us.

19
00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:01.227
Grand sire let you choose
whether you'd be his heir.

20
00:03:01.935 --> 00:03:03.183
You told us so.

21
00:03:07.464 --> 00:03:10.056
And do you want to know the truth of it?

22
00:03:12.826 --> 00:03:14.362
I was frightened.

23
00:03:16.067 --> 00:03:18.895
I was... four-and-ten.

24
00:03:19.163 --> 00:03:20.811
Same as you are now.

25
00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.660
I wasn't ready

26
00:03:22.685 --> 00:03:25.563
to be Queen of the Seven Kingdoms.

27
00:03:25.588 --> 00:03:28.383
But... it was my duty.

28
00:03:28.823 --> 00:03:31.435
And. in time. I came to understand

29
00:03:31.531 --> 00:03:33.676
I had to earn my inheritance.

30
00:03:35.403 --> 00:03:36.875
I'm not like you.

31
00:03:36.963 --> 00:03:39.353
- In what way. sweet boy?
- I'm not so...

32
00:03:41.611 --> 00:03:43.183
perfect.

33
00:03:49.355 --> 00:03:50.604
(kisses)

34
00:03:51.943 --> 00:03:55.362
- I am anything but.
- (footsteps approach)

35
00:03:55.363 --> 00:03:56.898
My father looked after me

36
00:03:56.931 --> 00:03:59.394
and helped to prepare me for my duties.

37
00:03:59.467 --> 00:04:02.383
Your mother will do the same for you.

38
00:04:03.183 --> 00:04:04.463
Lorent Marbrand: Good morrow. Princess.

39
00:04:04.663 --> 00:04:06.383
Good morrow. Ser Lorent.

40
00:04:07.303 --> 00:04:09.643
Princess Rhaenys has
just arrived on dragon back.

41
00:04:09.763 --> 00:04:12.715
She urgently requests an audience
with you and Prince Daemon.

42
00:04:19.211 --> 00:04:20.716
(door opens)

43
00:04:30.115 --> 00:04:32.146
The Princess Rhaenys Targaryen.

44
00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.708
Thank you. Ser Lorent.

45
00:04:37.509 --> 00:04:39.045
Princess Rhaenys...

46
00:04:39.564 --> 00:04:42.235
might we hope for news
of Lord Corlys's recovery?

47
00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:43.307
Viserys is dead.

48
00:04:45.835 --> 00:04:48.523
♪ ♪

49
00:04:49.342 --> 00:04:51.934
I grieve this loss with you. Rhaenyra.

50
00:04:51.959 --> 00:04:54.903
My cousin. your father...

51
00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.850
possessed a kind heart.

52
00:05:08.605 --> 00:05:10.263
There is more.

53
00:05:11.543 --> 00:05:14.143
Aegon has been crowned as his successor.

54
00:05:15.943 --> 00:05:17.771
(whimpers)

55
00:05:20.711 --> 00:05:22.470
They crowned him?

56
00:05:24.168 --> 00:05:26.443
How did Viserys die?

57
00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:27.983
I could not say.

58
00:05:28.743 --> 00:05:31.115
- How long ago?
- A day past. perhaps two.

59
00:05:31.211 --> 00:05:32.180
I was made a prisoner in my quarters

60
00:05:32.203 --> 00:05:33.612
while the Queen made her preparations.

61
00:05:33.637 --> 00:05:35.143
Viserys has been slain.

62
00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:40.923
Alicent demanded you declare for Aegon.

63
00:05:42.223 --> 00:05:43.463
She did.

64
00:05:45.822 --> 00:05:48.606
- I refused her.
- And yet you are alive.

65
00:05:51.519 --> 00:05:55.082
The High Septon crowned Aegon
in the Dragon pit.

66
00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:57.923
I witnessed it myself
just before I fled on Meleys.

67
00:05:58.172 --> 00:06:01.365
They crowned him before the masses.

68
00:06:01.398 --> 00:06:03.785
Princess Rhaenys: So that the masses
would see him as their rightful king.

69
00:06:03.851 --> 00:06:06.906
That whore of a Queen murdered
my brother and stole his throne.

70
00:06:06.987 --> 00:06:09.202
And you could have
burned them all for it.

71
00:06:09.203 --> 00:06:12.329
A war is like to be fought
over this treachery. to be sure.

72
00:06:13.463 --> 00:06:14.795
Mm.

73
00:06:16.331 --> 00:06:18.823
But that war is not mine to begin.

74
00:06:19.503 --> 00:06:21.115
I only rushed this warning to you

75
00:06:21.195 --> 00:06:23.596
out of loyalty to my
husband and to my house.

76
00:06:25.474 --> 00:06:27.392
The Greens are coming for you. Rhaenyra.

77
00:06:28.538 --> 00:06:29.943
And for your children.

78
00:06:31.884 --> 00:06:33.835
You should leave Dragons tone at once.

79
00:06:33.931 --> 00:06:35.915
(tense music playing)

80
00:06:36.715 --> 00:06:39.211
(whimpers. gasps)

81
00:06:52.715 --> 00:06:55.115
The babe is coming.

82
00:06:55.211 --> 00:06:57.451
(breathing heavily)

83
00:06:58.027 --> 00:06:59.627
(Rhaenyra groaning)

84
00:07:01.888 --> 00:07:04.018
Her term is far from complete.

85
00:07:04.043 --> 00:07:05.562
This should not be happening.

86
00:07:05.563 --> 00:07:08.183
It is fucking happening.

87
00:07:09.183 --> 00:07:12.186
Older Midwife: Keep your head about
you. Princess. Come.

88
00:07:12.663 --> 00:07:15.595
Elinda: We've done
this five times before.

89
00:07:15.691 --> 00:07:17.946
Keep your spirit.
and the sixth will be no different.

90
00:07:18.027 --> 00:07:20.314
Get off. get off. get off. get off!

91
00:07:20.395 --> 00:07:23.116
Ow. ow. ow. (gasps)

92
00:07:26.014 --> 00:07:28.162
I want patrols along
the island's perimeter.

93
00:07:28.163 --> 00:07:30.623
looking for any small ships
that might set ashore.

94
00:07:31.063 --> 00:07:33.691
If the Greens attack now.
it will be by stealth...

95
00:07:33.772 --> 00:07:35.442
- (Rhaenyra groaning)
- ...not directly.

96
00:07:35.443 --> 00:07:37.493
We don't have enough men
to surround the island.

97
00:07:37.516 --> 00:07:40.091
but we can make ourselves
appear stronger than they are.

98
00:07:40.171 --> 00:07:43.024
(Rhaenyra screaming)

99
00:07:43.025 --> 00:07:45.418
Conscript the Dragon keepers.
They're capable fighters.

100
00:07:45.443 --> 00:07:47.926
- Waste no time.
- It will be done. my Prince.

101
00:07:48.102 --> 00:07:50.974
(Rhaenyra screaming)

102
00:07:51.085 --> 00:07:53.421
- (grunting)
- (swords clanging)

103
00:07:59.129 --> 00:08:02.874
- What was that?
- (grunts) I'm sorry.

104
00:08:03.563 --> 00:08:05.434
You might go easier

105
00:08:05.515 --> 00:08:07.043
on him. my Prince.

106
00:08:07.068 --> 00:08:09.334
so he can learn what
you're trying to teach.

107
00:08:09.403 --> 00:08:12.043
Rhaenys: Your lady
mother needs to see you!

108
00:08:13.447 --> 00:08:14.783
Both of you.

109
00:08:15.343 --> 00:08:17.743
- (gasps)
- Prince Jacaerys: Mother?

110
00:08:18.023 --> 00:08:20.762
(Rhaenyra groaning)

111
00:08:20.763 --> 00:08:22.383
Rhaenyra: Fuck.

112
00:08:24.543 --> 00:08:26.042
Maester Gerardys: Princess.

113
00:08:26.043 --> 00:08:32.588
♪ ♪

114
00:08:36.594 --> 00:08:39.002
Your grand sire. King Viserys. has passed.

115
00:08:39.003 --> 00:08:40.063
V-Viserys?

116
00:08:40.383 --> 00:08:43.355
The Greens have repudiated the succession

117
00:08:43.435 --> 00:08:45.131
and claimed the Iron Throne.

118
00:08:48.714 --> 00:08:50.743
Aegon has been crowned king.

119
00:08:51.743 --> 00:08:54.299
- What is to be done about it?
- Nothing yet.

120
00:08:54.643 --> 00:08:57.082
- And where is Daemon?
- Rhaenyra: I don't know.

121
00:08:57.083 --> 00:08:58.891
Gone to madness.

122
00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.383
Gone to plot his war.

123
00:09:03.303 --> 00:09:06.155
- Jacaerys: Leave Daemon with me.
- Rhaenyra: Jace.

124
00:09:06.923 --> 00:09:08.143
Jacaerys.

125
00:09:13.024 --> 00:09:16.683
Whatever claim remains to me.
you are now its heir.

126
00:09:16.971 --> 00:09:19.703
Naught is to be done but by my command.

127
00:09:27.543 --> 00:09:29.323
(groaning)

128
00:09:33.743 --> 00:09:35.903
Bartimos Celtigar:
A raven flew in this morning.

129
00:09:35.983 --> 00:09:37.407
The Sea Snake's fever has broken.

130
00:09:37.487 --> 00:09:39.002
and he has left Even fall.

131
00:09:39.003 --> 00:09:41.703
- Where is he sailing?
- That much is unclear. my Prince.

132
00:09:42.103 --> 00:09:44.042
We'll send ravens to our nearest allies:

133
00:09:44.043 --> 00:09:46.383
Lords Darklyn. Massey...

134
00:09:47.011 --> 00:09:49.663
- and Bar Emmon.
- Rhaenyra: (shouts) Daemon!

135
00:09:49.818 --> 00:09:52.167
Do you want to speak
to the maester. my Prince?

136
00:10:00.218 --> 00:10:02.378
I'll fly to the River lands myself

137
00:10:02.403 --> 00:10:03.698
and affirm Lord Tully's support.

138
00:10:03.778 --> 00:10:05.283
You will do no such thing.

139
00:10:07.489 --> 00:10:10.463
My mother has decreed no action
be taken while she's abed.

140
00:10:16.703 --> 00:10:19.103
It's good you're here. young Prince.

141
00:10:19.743 --> 00:10:22.218
You're needed to patrol
the skies on Vermax.

142
00:10:22.243 --> 00:10:23.578
Did you hear what I said?

143
00:10:23.603 --> 00:10:26.083
(Rhaenyra screaming)

144
00:10:27.558 --> 00:10:28.935
The ravens. Lord Bartimos.

145
00:10:30.765 --> 00:10:32.290
I shall see it done.

146
00:10:32.323 --> 00:10:33.826
Summon Ser Steffon.

147
00:10:33.922 --> 00:10:36.323
Our Kings guard are needed
on the Dragonmont.

148
00:10:36.703 --> 00:10:39.875
Come with me. I'll show you
the true meaning of loyalty.

149
00:10:46.943 --> 00:10:49.642
You swore an oath
as knights of the Kings guard.

150
00:10:49.643 --> 00:10:52.203
As do all who wear
the white cloak. my Prince.

151
00:10:53.393 --> 00:10:54.663
To whom?

152
00:10:55.626 --> 00:10:58.943
I swore first to King
Jaehaerys. my Prince.

153
00:10:59.543 --> 00:11:00.946
And then to His Grace.

154
00:11:01.027 --> 00:11:03.082
King Viserys. when he succeeded him.

155
00:11:03.083 --> 00:11:05.343
Do you acknowledge
the true line of succession?

156
00:11:05.663 --> 00:11:07.523
- Yes.
- Yes. my Prince.

157
00:11:07.811 --> 00:11:09.250
♪ ♪

158
00:11:13.835 --> 00:11:15.283
Do you recall...

159
00:11:15.743 --> 00:11:18.903
who King Viserys named
as his heir before his death?

160
00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.383
Princess Rhaenyra.

161
00:11:24.962 --> 00:11:26.706
Hm.

162
00:11:27.183 --> 00:11:30.023
I'm grateful for your long
service to the crown.

163
00:11:31.663 --> 00:11:33.906
So I'm presenting you with a choice.

164
00:11:33.987 --> 00:11:36.003
(Caraxes screeches)

165
00:11:44.547 --> 00:11:46.082
(roars)

166
00:11:50.691 --> 00:11:53.346
♪ ♪

167
00:11:55.863 --> 00:11:59.303
Swear anew your oath
to Rhaenyra as your queen...

168
00:11:59.983 --> 00:12:02.875
<i>to Prince Jacaerys as the
heir to the Iron Throne.</i>

169
00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.993
(groaning. breathing heavily)

170
00:12:06.684 --> 00:12:08.843
- (roars)
- Prince Daemon:<i> Or...</i>

171
00:12:09.548 --> 00:12:11.703
if you support the usurper.
speak it now...

172
00:12:12.943 --> 00:12:15.345
and you will have a clean
and honorable death.

173
00:12:16.218 --> 00:12:18.223
<i>But if you choose treachery.</i>

174
00:12:18.623 --> 00:12:22.210
<i>if you swear fealty now only
to later turn your cloaks...</i>

175
00:12:24.803 --> 00:12:26.543
know that you will die...

176
00:12:27.383 --> 00:12:28.673
screaming.

177
00:12:28.707 --> 00:12:29.986
(screams)

178
00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:31.171
(roars)

179
00:12:31.587 --> 00:12:32.931
(grunting)

180
00:12:34.563 --> 00:12:36.023
Princess. let us help you.

181
00:12:38.663 --> 00:12:40.903
- (groans) No.
- (growls)

182
00:12:42.823 --> 00:12:45.554
- (screams) Get out!
- Elinda: Princess. please.

183
00:12:45.635 --> 00:12:47.499
- Get out.
- You should not do this alone. Princess.

184
00:12:47.522 --> 00:12:48.481
Let us help you.

185
00:12:48.515 --> 00:12:50.050
(cries)

186
00:12:51.235 --> 00:12:52.514
(gasps)

187
00:12:55.267 --> 00:12:56.803
(screams)

188
00:13:05.443 --> 00:13:06.947
(screaming)

189
00:13:09.346 --> 00:13:11.106
(breathing heavily)

190
00:13:15.171 --> 00:13:16.355
(gasps)

191
00:13:26.114 --> 00:13:27.651
(cries)

192
00:13:29.674 --> 00:13:31.434
(breathing heavily)

193
00:13:50.434 --> 00:13:52.450
(somber music playing)

194
00:14:03.434 --> 00:14:07.082
♪ ♪

195
00:14:41.954 --> 00:14:43.907
(waves crashing)

196
00:14:44.003 --> 00:14:47.331
♪ ♪

197
00:15:19.202 --> 00:15:22.115
♪ ♪

198
00:15:40.803 --> 00:15:43.075
(flames crackling)

199
00:16:04.985 --> 00:16:06.904
Erryk Cargyll: I mean no harm. brothers.

200
00:16:23.683 --> 00:16:27.395
(light strings playing)

201
00:16:28.857 --> 00:16:30.943
I swear to ward the Queen...

202
00:16:33.616 --> 00:16:35.330
with all my strength...

203
00:16:36.743 --> 00:16:39.063
and give my blood for hers.

204
00:16:43.728 --> 00:16:45.723
I shall take no wife...

205
00:16:47.063 --> 00:16:48.963
hold no lands...

206
00:16:49.931 --> 00:16:51.603
father no children.

207
00:16:52.383 --> 00:16:54.503
I shall guard her secrets...

208
00:16:55.363 --> 00:16:57.023
obey her commands...

209
00:16:57.943 --> 00:17:01.570
ride at her side.
and defend her name and honor.

210
00:17:09.162 --> 00:17:11.594
♪ ♪

211
00:17:13.969 --> 00:17:15.921
♪ ♪

212
00:17:26.809 --> 00:17:28.185
My Queen.

213
00:17:41.266 --> 00:17:45.106
(regal music playing)

214
00:18:04.394 --> 00:18:08.042
♪ ♪

215
00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.803
♪ ♪

216
00:19:06.122 --> 00:19:09.543
Daemon: Queen Rhaenyra
Targaryen. First of Her Name.

217
00:19:09.929 --> 00:19:12.903
Queen of the Andals and the
Rhoynar and the First Men.

218
00:19:13.663 --> 00:19:16.823
Lady of the Seven Kingdoms
and Protector of the Realm.

219
00:19:20.582 --> 00:19:22.022
Your Grace.

220
00:19:30.441 --> 00:19:32.201
Wine. my Queen.

221
00:19:34.953 --> 00:19:36.234
Thank you. Rhaena.

222
00:19:37.161 --> 00:19:38.313
Come.

223
00:20:01.668 --> 00:20:03.917
- What is our standing?
- Daemon: We have 30 knights.

224
00:20:03.942 --> 00:20:06.186
a hundred crossbowmen.
and 300 men-at-arms.

225
00:20:06.281 --> 00:20:08.218
Dragons tone is relatively easy to defend.

226
00:20:08.243 --> 00:20:09.500
but as an instrument of conquest.

227
00:20:09.523 --> 00:20:11.667
our army leaves a lot to be desired.

228
00:20:11.763 --> 00:20:14.050
We have sent word to my
loyal men in the City Watch.

229
00:20:14.131 --> 00:20:15.010
I'll have some support there.

230
00:20:15.091 --> 00:20:16.220
but I cannot speak to the numbers.

231
00:20:16.243 --> 00:20:19.898
We already have declarations
from Celtigar and St aunt on.

232
00:20:19.923 --> 00:20:22.355
Massey. Darklyn. Bar Emmon.

233
00:20:24.619 --> 00:20:26.338
My lady mother was an Arryn.

234
00:20:26.683 --> 00:20:29.202
The Vale will not turn
cloak against their own kin.

235
00:20:29.203 --> 00:20:30.755
River run was always a close friend

236
00:20:30.835 --> 00:20:32.595
to your father. Your Grace.

237
00:20:32.691 --> 00:20:34.274
With Prince Daemon's acquiescence.

238
00:20:34.355 --> 00:20:36.783
I've already sent ravens to Lord Grover.

239
00:20:40.023 --> 00:20:42.858
Lord Grover is fickle and easily swayed.

240
00:20:42.883 --> 00:20:44.963
He will need to be convinced
of the strength of our position

241
00:20:45.043 --> 00:20:47.562
and that we will support him
should it come to war.

242
00:20:47.563 --> 00:20:49.603
I'm going to treat with him myself.

243
00:20:49.693 --> 00:20:51.418
Steffon Darklyn: What of
Storm's End and Winter fell?

244
00:20:51.443 --> 00:20:54.030
Bartimos: There has never lived
a Stark who forgot an oath.

245
00:20:54.055 --> 00:20:56.682
And with House Stark.
the North will follow.

246
00:20:56.683 --> 00:21:00.383
Lord Borros Baratheon will need to
be reminded of his father's promises.

247
00:21:12.543 --> 00:21:14.591
What news from Driftmark?

248
00:21:17.076 --> 00:21:19.223
Lord Corlys sails for Dragons tone.

249
00:21:19.403 --> 00:21:21.086
To declare for his Queen.

250
00:21:22.472 --> 00:21:25.063
The Velaryon fleet is
in my husband's yoke.

251
00:21:25.463 --> 00:21:27.183
He decides where they sail.

252
00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:30.493
Rhaenyra: We shall pray for both
you and your husband's support.

253
00:21:30.707 --> 00:21:33.872
Just as we prayed nightly for the
Sea Snake's return to good health.

254
00:21:34.961 --> 00:21:37.038
There's no port on the
Narrow Sea would dare to make

255
00:21:37.063 --> 00:21:38.931
an enemy of the Velaryon fleet.

256
00:21:40.665 --> 00:21:43.563
- And our enemies?
- We have no friends among the Lannisters.

257
00:21:44.035 --> 00:21:46.623
Tyland has served the Hand
too long to turn against him.

258
00:21:46.903 --> 00:21:49.122
And Otto High tower
needs the Lannister fleet.

259
00:21:49.123 --> 00:21:50.652
Without the Lannisters.
we are not like to find

260
00:21:50.675 --> 00:21:53.073
- any allies west of the Golden Tooth.
- Daemon: No.

261
00:21:55.818 --> 00:21:57.943
The River lands are essential. Your Grace.

262
00:21:59.187 --> 00:22:00.866
Pray forgive my bluntness. Your Grace.

263
00:22:00.947 --> 00:22:02.733
but talk of men is moot.

264
00:22:03.043 --> 00:22:05.075
Your cause owns a power

265
00:22:05.171 --> 00:22:06.850
that has not been seen in this world

266
00:22:06.931 --> 00:22:09.162
since the days of Old Valyria.

267
00:22:09.163 --> 00:22:10.383
Dragons.

268
00:22:13.322 --> 00:22:15.050
The Greens have dragons as well.

269
00:22:15.123 --> 00:22:16.858
Daemon: They have three
adults. by my count.

270
00:22:16.883 --> 00:22:19.682
We have Syrax. Caraxes. and Meleys.

271
00:22:19.683 --> 00:22:22.363
Your sons have Vermax.
Arrax. and Tyraxes.

272
00:22:22.523 --> 00:22:24.162
Baela has Moondancer.

273
00:22:24.163 --> 00:22:26.307
Daemon. none of our dragons
have been to war.

274
00:22:26.387 --> 00:22:28.275
There are also unclaimed dragons.

275
00:22:28.463 --> 00:22:30.307
Sea smoke still resides on Driftmark.

276
00:22:30.387 --> 00:22:33.154
Vermithor and Silver wing
dwell on the Dragonmont.

277
00:22:33.235 --> 00:22:34.623
still riderless.

278
00:22:35.103 --> 00:22:37.660
Then there are the three wild
dragons. all of whom nest here.

279
00:22:37.683 --> 00:22:39.043
Rhaenyra: And who is to ride them?

280
00:22:39.123 --> 00:22:42.082
Daemon: Dragons tone has 13 to their 4.

281
00:22:42.083 --> 00:22:44.943
I also have a score of eggs
incubating in the Dragonmont.

282
00:22:45.223 --> 00:22:48.642
Now... we need a place to gather.

283
00:22:48.643 --> 00:22:52.307
a toehold large enough
to house a sizable host.

284
00:22:52.403 --> 00:22:54.115
Here. at Harrenhal. We cut off the west.

285
00:22:54.195 --> 00:22:55.938
surround King's Landing with the dragons.

286
00:22:55.963 --> 00:22:57.898
And we could have every
Green head mounted on spikes

287
00:22:57.923 --> 00:22:59.362
before the fucking moon turns.

288
00:22:59.363 --> 00:23:00.554
Your Grace...

289
00:23:00.783 --> 00:23:02.802
a ship has been sighted offshore:

290
00:23:02.803 --> 00:23:04.092
a lone galleon. flying a banner

291
00:23:04.115 --> 00:23:05.442
of a three-headed green dragon.

292
00:23:05.523 --> 00:23:07.703
Alert the watchtowers. Sight the skies.

293
00:23:08.063 --> 00:23:11.475
(tense music playing)

294
00:23:32.691 --> 00:23:34.643
♪ ♪

295
00:23:43.503 --> 00:23:46.547
I come at the behest
of the Dowager Queen Alicent.

296
00:23:46.643 --> 00:23:48.755
mother of King Aegon. Second of His Name.

297
00:23:48.851 --> 00:23:51.243
Lord and Protector of the Seven Kingdoms.

298
00:23:52.023 --> 00:23:53.962
I've been directed to deliver her message

299
00:23:54.035 --> 00:23:56.103
only to Princess Rhaenyra.

300
00:23:57.303 --> 00:23:58.783
Where is the Princess?

301
00:23:59.763 --> 00:24:01.715
(Syrax screeches)

302
00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:07.132
(roars)

303
00:24:10.963 --> 00:24:12.211
(screeches)

304
00:24:22.803 --> 00:24:24.275
(roaring)

305
00:24:26.794 --> 00:24:29.386
(bellows)

306
00:24:36.275 --> 00:24:37.523
(roars)

307
00:24:51.247 --> 00:24:53.023
Princess Rhaenyra.

308
00:24:54.131 --> 00:24:56.223
I'm Queen Rhaenyra now.

309
00:24:56.783 --> 00:24:59.635
And you all are traitors to the realm.

310
00:24:59.731 --> 00:25:03.507
King Aegon Targaryen.
Second of His Name...

311
00:25:04.741 --> 00:25:07.663
in his wisdom and desire for peace.

312
00:25:08.183 --> 00:25:09.963
is offering terms.

313
00:25:11.823 --> 00:25:13.898
Acknowledge Aegon as king

314
00:25:13.923 --> 00:25:16.618
and swear obeisance
before the Iron Throne.

315
00:25:16.643 --> 00:25:18.578
In exchange. His Grace will confirm

316
00:25:18.603 --> 00:25:20.463
your possession of Dragons tone.

317
00:25:21.063 --> 00:25:22.762
It will pass to your true born son.

318
00:25:22.763 --> 00:25:24.522
Jacaerys. upon your death.

319
00:25:24.523 --> 00:25:25.922
Lucerys will be confirmed

320
00:25:25.923 --> 00:25:27.762
as the legitimate heir to Driftmark

321
00:25:27.763 --> 00:25:30.402
and all the lands and
holdings of House Velaryon.

322
00:25:30.403 --> 00:25:32.322
Your sons by Prince Daemon

323
00:25:32.323 --> 00:25:35.522
will also be given places
of high honor at court:

324
00:25:35.523 --> 00:25:37.962
Aegon the Younger as the King's squire.

325
00:25:37.963 --> 00:25:39.803
Viserys as his cupbearer.

326
00:25:39.883 --> 00:25:41.882
Finally. the King. in his good grace.

327
00:25:41.883 --> 00:25:44.042
will pardon any knight or lord

328
00:25:44.043 --> 00:25:46.522
who conspired against his ascent.

329
00:25:46.523 --> 00:25:49.338
I would rather feed
my sons to the dragons

330
00:25:49.363 --> 00:25:52.306
than have them carry shields and cups

331
00:25:52.403 --> 00:25:56.242
for your drunken. usurper cunt of a king.

332
00:25:56.243 --> 00:25:59.890
Aegon Targaryen sits the Iron Throne.

333
00:26:00.603 --> 00:26:02.498
He wears the Conqueror's crown.

334
00:26:02.523 --> 00:26:04.298
wields the Conqueror's sword.

335
00:26:04.323 --> 00:26:06.002
has the Conqueror's name.

336
00:26:06.003 --> 00:26:08.660
He was anointed by a septon of the Faith

337
00:26:08.755 --> 00:26:10.378
before the eyes of thousands.

338
00:26:10.410 --> 00:26:14.463
Every symbol of legitimacy
belongs to him.

339
00:26:16.423 --> 00:26:19.747
And then there is Stark.
Tully. Baratheon.

340
00:26:19.843 --> 00:26:21.922
Houses that have also received.

341
00:26:21.923 --> 00:26:23.762
and are at present.

342
00:26:23.763 --> 00:26:26.863
considering generous terms
from their king.

343
00:26:28.371 --> 00:26:31.783
Stark. Tully. and Baratheon
all swore to me

344
00:26:32.371 --> 00:26:35.363
when King Viserys named me his heir.

345
00:26:35.443 --> 00:26:39.955
Stale oaths will not put you
on the Iron Throne. Princess.

346
00:26:40.058 --> 00:26:44.036
The succession changed the day
your father sired a son.

347
00:26:44.323 --> 00:26:48.243
I only regret that you and he were
the last to see the truth of it.

348
00:26:49.023 --> 00:26:51.155
You are no more Hand than Aegon is king.

349
00:26:51.251 --> 00:26:52.851
Fucking traitor.

350
00:27:04.016 --> 00:27:05.583
Grand Maester.

351
00:27:10.803 --> 00:27:12.342
What the fuck is this?

352
00:27:17.331 --> 00:27:18.612
(solemn music playing)

353
00:27:26.803 --> 00:27:29.178
Otto High tower: Queen Alicent
has not forgotten the love

354
00:27:29.203 --> 00:27:30.983
you once had for each other.

355
00:27:31.663 --> 00:27:33.778
No blood need be spilled.

356
00:27:33.863 --> 00:27:37.011
so the realm can carry on in peace.

357
00:27:40.565 --> 00:27:42.778
Queen Alicent eagerly awaits your answer.

358
00:27:42.803 --> 00:27:45.275
She can have her answer now.
stuffed in her father's mouth

359
00:27:45.300 --> 00:27:46.418
along with his withered cock.

360
00:27:46.443 --> 00:27:48.083
Let's end this mummer's farce.

361
00:27:49.452 --> 00:27:51.338
Ser Erryk. bring me Lord High tower

362
00:27:51.363 --> 00:27:52.885
so I may take the pleasure myself.

363
00:27:52.980 --> 00:27:54.900
(Syrax roars)

364
00:27:57.426 --> 00:27:58.513
No.

365
00:28:01.812 --> 00:28:04.725
♪ ♪

366
00:28:09.676 --> 00:28:12.263
King's Landing will have
my answer on the morrow.

367
00:28:26.420 --> 00:28:27.861
(roars)

368
00:28:33.684 --> 00:28:36.612
Daemon: It's no easy thing for
a man to be a dragons layer.

369
00:28:37.103 --> 00:28:40.183
But dragons can kill dragons. And have.

370
00:28:41.103 --> 00:28:44.484
The simple truth is this:
we have more dragons than Aegon.

371
00:28:44.564 --> 00:28:46.805
Viserys spoke often
of the Valyrian histories.

372
00:28:46.901 --> 00:28:48.383
I know them well.

373
00:28:48.783 --> 00:28:51.220
When dragons flew to war...

374
00:28:51.820 --> 00:28:53.164
everything burned.

375
00:28:55.196 --> 00:28:58.163
I do not wish to rule over
a kingdom of ash and bone.

376
00:28:58.343 --> 00:29:01.023
Are you considering the High towers'
terms. Your Grace?

377
00:29:01.623 --> 00:29:03.095
As Queen. what is my true duty

378
00:29:03.191 --> 00:29:05.482
to the realm. Lord Bartimos?

379
00:29:05.483 --> 00:29:07.127
Ensuring peace and unity?

380
00:29:07.224 --> 00:29:10.033
Or that I sit the Iron Throne.
no matter the cost?

381
00:29:10.203 --> 00:29:12.568
- That's your father talking.
- My father's dead.

382
00:29:14.085 --> 00:29:16.164
And he chose me as his successor...

383
00:29:18.520 --> 00:29:21.182
to defend the realm.
not cast it headlong into war.

384
00:29:21.271 --> 00:29:22.528
Well. the enemy have declared war.

385
00:29:23.200 --> 00:29:25.144
What are you gonna do about it?

386
00:29:28.084 --> 00:29:29.303
Clear the room.

387
00:29:58.548 --> 00:30:00.378
Does the promise of war excite you?

388
00:30:00.403 --> 00:30:01.991
You cannot bend the knee
to the High towers.

389
00:30:02.071 --> 00:30:03.587
They stole your birthright.

390
00:30:03.683 --> 00:30:05.176
If you could take the Iron Throne

391
00:30:05.272 --> 00:30:07.335
without putting Otto
Hightower's head on a spike.

392
00:30:07.415 --> 00:30:08.711
- would you?
- Are you not angry?

393
00:30:08.791 --> 00:30:11.095
- I should declare war because I'm angry?
- No.

394
00:30:11.191 --> 00:30:13.109
Because it's your duty
as Queen to crush rebellion.

395
00:30:13.143 --> 00:30:14.407
You know my oath

396
00:30:14.487 --> 00:30:17.015
reaches beyond our personal ambitions.

397
00:30:19.777 --> 00:30:21.643
A Song of Ice and Fire.

398
00:30:24.247 --> 00:30:25.495
What?

399
00:30:26.720 --> 00:30:28.658
The coming war against
the darkness in the North.

400
00:30:28.683 --> 00:30:30.202
The Conqueror's Dream.

401
00:30:30.203 --> 00:30:32.615
Viserys shared it with me
when he named me heir.

402
00:30:32.695 --> 00:30:35.191
(struggles to breathe)

403
00:30:37.107 --> 00:30:41.343
My brother...
was a slave to his omens and portents.

404
00:30:41.943 --> 00:30:44.055
Anything to make his feckless reign

405
00:30:44.151 --> 00:30:45.688
appear to have purpose.

406
00:30:49.068 --> 00:30:50.903
Dreams didn't make us kings.

407
00:30:51.983 --> 00:30:53.263
Dragons did.

408
00:30:55.704 --> 00:30:58.231
(tense music playing)

409
00:30:59.223 --> 00:31:01.943
(breathing heavily)

410
00:31:10.571 --> 00:31:12.043
He never told you...

411
00:31:12.663 --> 00:31:13.847
(panting)

412
00:31:15.743 --> 00:31:17.176
Did he?

413
00:31:17.976 --> 00:31:19.704
♪ ♪

414
00:31:52.889 --> 00:31:57.017
I've had men whipped for
falling asleep on their watch.

415
00:32:02.883 --> 00:32:04.387
You are no man.

416
00:32:08.743 --> 00:32:10.803
You abandoned me...

417
00:32:12.471 --> 00:32:14.264
when I most needed you.

418
00:32:15.191 --> 00:32:17.304
Both our children stolen from us.

419
00:32:18.743 --> 00:32:20.363
I needed you.

420
00:32:20.383 --> 00:32:21.938
Baela and Rhaena needed you.

421
00:32:21.963 --> 00:32:24.763
and you abandoned us
for more adventure at sea.

422
00:32:25.047 --> 00:32:26.904
As has always been your way.

423
00:32:28.556 --> 00:32:30.892
Corlys Velaryon:
I had no other place to turn.

424
00:32:32.504 --> 00:32:35.544
- I lost everything.
- We lost. Corlys.

425
00:32:37.307 --> 00:32:38.706
We.

426
00:32:50.751 --> 00:32:53.055
I understand we have a new king.

427
00:32:53.143 --> 00:32:56.504
The Stranger casts a long
shadow over this family.

428
00:33:02.616 --> 00:33:04.583
Your brother is also dead.

429
00:33:04.855 --> 00:33:07.383
(gasps. groans)

430
00:33:09.111 --> 00:33:12.007
In his haste to bury you
and claim your seat.

431
00:33:12.087 --> 00:33:13.528
he stood before the King

432
00:33:13.623 --> 00:33:16.343
and denounced Laenor's
sons as illegitimate.

433
00:33:17.495 --> 00:33:20.408
(sighs)

434
00:33:21.171 --> 00:33:23.538
- Daemon took his head for it.
- (scoffs)

435
00:33:27.978 --> 00:33:32.103
Heedless ambition has always
been a Velaryon weakness.

436
00:33:36.400 --> 00:33:38.703
You were right. Rhaenys.

437
00:33:40.063 --> 00:33:43.403
I reached too far. And for nothing.

438
00:33:45.790 --> 00:33:50.183
Our pursuit of the Iron Throne...
is at an end.

439
00:33:54.503 --> 00:33:57.343
We shall declare for no one.

440
00:33:58.935 --> 00:34:01.042
We will retire to High Tide

441
00:34:01.043 --> 00:34:02.623
to be content...

442
00:34:03.103 --> 00:34:05.575
with our grandchildren and...

443
00:34:05.655 --> 00:34:08.223
Jace. Luke. and Joff are
claimants to the throne.

444
00:34:10.295 --> 00:34:13.175
Those boys'll not be safe
so long as Aegon is king.

445
00:34:15.384 --> 00:34:19.223
Rhaenyra was complicit
in our son's death.

446
00:34:20.700 --> 00:34:23.430
That girl destroys
everything she touches.

447
00:34:23.510 --> 00:34:25.003
That "girl"...

448
00:34:25.143 --> 00:34:27.703
is holding the realm together at present.

449
00:34:28.263 --> 00:34:30.310
Every man standing
'round the Painted Table

450
00:34:30.391 --> 00:34:32.471
urges her to plunge the realm into war.

451
00:34:34.427 --> 00:34:37.403
<i>Rhaenyra's the only one
who's demonstrated restraint.</i>

452
00:34:37.783 --> 00:34:39.938
Bartimos: The purpose of
war is to fill graveyards.

453
00:34:39.963 --> 00:34:41.066
my dear Lord St aunt on.

454
00:34:41.154 --> 00:34:42.962
The trick is to put more of their men

455
00:34:42.963 --> 00:34:44.283
in the ground than your own.

456
00:34:44.308 --> 00:34:45.945
Easy words for a lord who commands

457
00:34:45.946 --> 00:34:47.682
- from the safety of his castle.
- Doesn't make it any less true.

458
00:34:47.683 --> 00:34:49.403
Erryk: The Lord of the Tides!

459
00:34:49.627 --> 00:34:51.423
Lord Corlys Velaryon...

460
00:34:52.463 --> 00:34:55.863
and his wife.
the Princess Rhaenys Targaryen.

461
00:35:06.518 --> 00:35:07.783
My lords.

462
00:35:08.143 --> 00:35:09.543
Rhaenyra: Lord Corlys.

463
00:35:10.583 --> 00:35:13.143
It brings much relief to see
you hale and healthy again.

464
00:35:15.383 --> 00:35:18.063
I'm very sorry about your
father. Princess.

465
00:35:18.615 --> 00:35:20.150
He was a good man.

466
00:35:31.383 --> 00:35:32.943
Where is Daemon?

467
00:35:33.494 --> 00:35:36.468
There were other concerns which
demanded the Prince's attention.

468
00:35:37.623 --> 00:35:38.743
Mm.

469
00:35:47.278 --> 00:35:49.028
Your declared allies?

470
00:35:50.263 --> 00:35:53.687
- Yes.
- Too few to win a war for the throne.

471
00:35:55.070 --> 00:35:58.098
Well. we would also
hope to have the support

472
00:35:58.123 --> 00:36:00.808
- of Houses Arryn. Baratheon. and Stark.
- Corlys: Hope...

473
00:36:01.707 --> 00:36:03.275
is the fool's ally.

474
00:36:04.571 --> 00:36:07.562
Both Arryn and Baratheon
share blood with my house.

475
00:36:07.743 --> 00:36:09.775
But all of them swore oaths to me.

476
00:36:09.840 --> 00:36:11.403
As did House High tower...

477
00:36:11.715 --> 00:36:12.691
if I remember.

478
00:36:12.843 --> 00:36:15.543
As did you. Lord Corlys.

479
00:36:28.939 --> 00:36:30.540
Your father's realm...

480
00:36:31.461 --> 00:36:34.103
was one of justice and honor.

481
00:36:35.143 --> 00:36:37.946
Our houses are bound by common blood

482
00:36:38.027 --> 00:36:39.595
and common cause.

483
00:36:40.523 --> 00:36:43.543
This High tower treason cannot stand.

484
00:36:49.156 --> 00:36:52.779
You have the full support
of our fleet and house.

485
00:36:53.979 --> 00:36:55.463
Your Grace.

486
00:37:01.675 --> 00:37:03.147
♪ ♪

487
00:37:03.623 --> 00:37:05.739
You honor me. Lord Corlys.

488
00:37:11.595 --> 00:37:13.183
Princess Rhaenys.

489
00:37:17.183 --> 00:37:20.563
But. as I said to my bannermen.

490
00:37:20.815 --> 00:37:22.323
I made a promise to my father

491
00:37:22.356 --> 00:37:24.703
to hold the realm strong and united.

492
00:37:26.183 --> 00:37:27.899
If war's first stroke is to fall.

493
00:37:27.979 --> 00:37:29.259
it will not be by my hand.

494
00:37:30.632 --> 00:37:32.098
You do not mean to act?

495
00:37:32.123 --> 00:37:35.442
Taking caution
does not mean standing fast.

496
00:37:35.443 --> 00:37:37.563
I wish to know who my allies are

497
00:37:38.343 --> 00:37:40.346
before I send them to war.

498
00:37:40.427 --> 00:37:42.379
♪ ♪

499
00:37:47.609 --> 00:37:49.243
The consequence of my...

500
00:37:50.063 --> 00:37:53.163
near-demise in the Step stones...

501
00:37:54.128 --> 00:37:55.943
is that we now control them.

502
00:37:56.543 --> 00:37:59.163
I took care to fully garrison
the territory this time.

503
00:37:59.275 --> 00:38:00.922
A total blockade of the shipping lanes

504
00:38:01.003 --> 00:38:03.463
will be in place in days. if not already.

505
00:38:03.943 --> 00:38:05.803
The Triarchy have been routed.

506
00:38:06.475 --> 00:38:08.460
The Narrow Sea is ours.

507
00:38:11.115 --> 00:38:13.739
If we... further seal the Gullet.

508
00:38:13.835 --> 00:38:16.547
we can cut off all
seaborne travel and trade

509
00:38:16.603 --> 00:38:18.143
to King's Landing.

510
00:38:18.903 --> 00:38:21.483
I shall take Meleys
and patrol the Gullet myself.

511
00:38:26.167 --> 00:38:28.343
Bartimos: When we drain the Narrow Sea.

512
00:38:28.843 --> 00:38:30.763
we can surround King's Landing.

513
00:38:30.943 --> 00:38:32.954
lay siege to the Red Keep.

514
00:38:33.283 --> 00:38:35.293
and force the Greens' surrender.

515
00:38:35.563 --> 00:38:38.903
If we are to have enough swords
to surround King's Landing.

516
00:38:39.223 --> 00:38:40.955
we must first secure the support

517
00:38:41.035 --> 00:38:42.762
of Winter fell. the Eyrie.
and Storm's End.

518
00:38:42.883 --> 00:38:45.243
I'll prepare the ravens. Your Grace.

519
00:38:45.623 --> 00:38:47.703
Jacaerys: We should bear those messages.

520
00:38:49.099 --> 00:38:51.503
Dragons can fly faster than ravens

521
00:38:51.823 --> 00:38:53.675
and they're more convincing.

522
00:38:56.939 --> 00:38:58.187
Send us.

523
00:38:59.965 --> 00:39:01.790
The Prince is right. Your Grace.

524
00:39:05.708 --> 00:39:07.276
(tense music playing)

525
00:39:10.635 --> 00:39:11.723
Very well.

526
00:39:12.402 --> 00:39:14.783
Prince Jacaerys will fly north.

527
00:39:15.660 --> 00:39:18.418
First to the Eyrie to see my mother's
cousin. the Lady Jeyne Arryn.

528
00:39:18.443 --> 00:39:21.738
and then to Winter fell
to treat with Lord Cregan Stark

529
00:39:21.763 --> 00:39:23.263
for the support of the North.

530
00:39:24.463 --> 00:39:27.180
Prince Lucerys will fly
south to Storm's End

531
00:39:27.275 --> 00:39:29.962
and treat with Lord Borros Baratheon.

532
00:39:29.963 --> 00:39:33.503
We must remind these lords
of the oaths they swore.

533
00:39:35.534 --> 00:39:38.318
And... the cost of breaking them.

534
00:39:39.147 --> 00:39:40.876
♪ ♪

535
00:40:01.433 --> 00:40:03.578
It's been said that as Targaryens.

536
00:40:03.603 --> 00:40:06.540
we are closer to gods than to men.

537
00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:11.096
And the Iron Throne puts
us a touch closer. perhaps.

538
00:40:12.722 --> 00:40:16.466
But. if we are to serve
the Seven Kingdoms...

539
00:40:17.428 --> 00:40:19.663
we must answer to their gods.

540
00:40:20.303 --> 00:40:24.583
If you take this errand.
you go as messengers... not as warriors.

541
00:40:25.343 --> 00:40:27.743
You must take no part in any fighting.

542
00:40:28.943 --> 00:40:30.731
Swear it to me now

543
00:40:31.023 --> 00:40:33.259
under the eyes of the Seven.

544
00:40:37.503 --> 00:40:39.019
I swear it.

545
00:40:43.183 --> 00:40:44.843
I swear it.

546
00:40:46.027 --> 00:40:47.543
Thank you.

547
00:40:50.143 --> 00:40:52.703
Cregan Stark is...

548
00:40:53.063 --> 00:40:55.098
close to your age than is mine.

549
00:40:55.123 --> 00:40:57.068
I would hope. that as men.

550
00:40:57.163 --> 00:40:59.066
you can find some common interest.

551
00:40:59.703 --> 00:41:01.103
Yes. Your Grace.

552
00:41:09.237 --> 00:41:11.463
Storm's End is a short flight from here.

553
00:41:12.823 --> 00:41:14.758
You have Baratheon blood

554
00:41:14.803 --> 00:41:16.562
from your grandmother. Rhaenys.

555
00:41:16.563 --> 00:41:17.663
And...

556
00:41:17.995 --> 00:41:20.623
Lord Borros is an eternally proud man.

557
00:41:21.023 --> 00:41:22.219
He will be honored

558
00:41:22.315 --> 00:41:24.503
to host a prince of the realm...

559
00:41:25.063 --> 00:41:26.379
and his dragon.

560
00:41:34.743 --> 00:41:37.463
I expect you will receive
a very warm welcome.

561
00:41:39.103 --> 00:41:41.195
Yes. Mother. Y-Your Grace.

562
00:41:47.224 --> 00:41:49.975
(spirited music playing)

563
00:41:50.000 --> 00:41:51.664
Go to it then.

564
00:41:52.427 --> 00:41:54.699
(Vermax roars)

565
00:42:00.139 --> 00:42:01.163
♪ ♪

566
00:42:21.355 --> 00:42:22.539
(roars)

567
00:42:44.236 --> 00:42:46.283
(Daemon sings in Old Valyrian)

568
00:43:12.715 --> 00:43:14.348
(rumbling)

569
00:43:14.443 --> 00:43:16.203
(singing continues)

570
00:43:39.275 --> 00:43:40.779
(roaring)

571
00:43:53.643 --> 00:43:55.403
(singing continues)

572
00:44:00.523 --> 00:44:02.507
(Vermithor grumbles)

573
00:44:11.787 --> 00:44:13.323
(grumbles)

574
00:44:21.515 --> 00:44:23.083
(thundering)

575
00:44:44.588 --> 00:44:47.499
(roars)

576
00:45:02.763 --> 00:45:04.459
(Arrax grumbles)

577
00:45:07.563 --> 00:45:09.259
(Vhagar roaring)

578
00:45:23.881 --> 00:45:26.218
I am Prince Lucerys Velaryon.

579
00:45:26.423 --> 00:45:28.903
I bring a message to Lord
Borros from the Queen.

580
00:45:36.626 --> 00:45:39.890
(tense music playing)

581
00:45:45.099 --> 00:45:47.179
Baratheon Knight:
Prince Lucerys Velaryon.

582
00:45:49.067 --> 00:45:50.603
(thundering)

583
00:45:53.209 --> 00:45:56.563
Son of Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen.

584
00:45:58.463 --> 00:45:59.627
(thunder continues)

585
00:46:00.425 --> 00:46:01.843
Lord Borros...

586
00:46:03.343 --> 00:46:05.483
I brought you a message from my mother...

587
00:46:06.463 --> 00:46:07.743
the Queen.

588
00:46:08.583 --> 00:46:11.923
Yet earlier this day.
I received an envoy from the King.

589
00:46:12.863 --> 00:46:13.899
Which is it?

590
00:46:14.573 --> 00:46:16.803
King or Queen?

591
00:46:17.163 --> 00:46:20.299
The House of the Dragon does
not seem to know who rules it.

592
00:46:20.395 --> 00:46:21.515
(laughs)

593
00:46:22.583 --> 00:46:24.983
What's your mother's message?

594
00:46:31.130 --> 00:46:33.531
(sighs)

595
00:46:40.478 --> 00:46:42.343
Where's the bloody maester?

596
00:46:45.995 --> 00:46:47.019
(wind whistling)

597
00:47:15.755 --> 00:47:19.023
"Remind" me of my father's oath.

598
00:47:20.216 --> 00:47:22.458
King Aegon at least came with an offer:

599
00:47:22.539 --> 00:47:25.123
my swords and banners
for a marriage pact.

600
00:47:26.303 --> 00:47:28.663
If I do as your mother bids...

601
00:47:29.423 --> 00:47:31.823
which one of my daughters will you wed...

602
00:47:33.263 --> 00:47:34.823
boy?

603
00:47:35.663 --> 00:47:38.623
My lord... I am not free to marry.

604
00:47:39.703 --> 00:47:41.419
I'm already betrothed.

605
00:47:43.435 --> 00:47:45.835
So you come with empty hands.

606
00:47:47.617 --> 00:47:49.183
Go home. pup.

607
00:47:49.743 --> 00:47:52.098
And tell your mother
that the Lord of Storm's End

608
00:47:52.123 --> 00:47:54.058
is not some dog that she can whistle up

609
00:47:54.083 --> 00:47:56.503
at need to set against her foes.

610
00:47:58.423 --> 00:48:02.104
I shall take your answer
to the Queen. my lord.

611
00:48:07.863 --> 00:48:09.559
Prince Aemond: Wait...

612
00:48:11.352 --> 00:48:12.856
my Lord Strong.

613
00:48:17.703 --> 00:48:19.362
Did you really think

614
00:48:19.363 --> 00:48:21.842
that you could just fly about the realm

615
00:48:21.843 --> 00:48:24.423
trying to steal my
brother's throne at no cost?

616
00:48:26.068 --> 00:48:27.583
I will not fight you.

617
00:48:28.531 --> 00:48:31.617
I came as a messenger. not a warrior.

618
00:48:31.683 --> 00:48:33.263
A fight would be little challenge.

619
00:48:35.987 --> 00:48:37.091
No.

620
00:48:37.823 --> 00:48:39.983
I want you to put out your eye.

621
00:48:42.834 --> 00:48:44.114
As payment for mine.

622
00:48:46.363 --> 00:48:47.743
One will serve.

623
00:48:51.380 --> 00:48:53.023
I would not blind you.

624
00:48:55.623 --> 00:48:57.983
Mm. plan to make a gift
of it to my mother.

625
00:49:02.067 --> 00:49:03.343
No.

626
00:49:04.083 --> 00:49:06.421
Then you are craven as well as a traitor.

627
00:49:06.446 --> 00:49:08.498
Not here. Give me your eye

628
00:49:08.523 --> 00:49:10.523
or I will take it. bastard!

629
00:49:11.082 --> 00:49:12.823
Not in my hall!

630
00:49:13.783 --> 00:49:15.432
The boy came as an envoy.

631
00:49:15.566 --> 00:49:17.884
I'll not have bloodshed beneath my roof.

632
00:49:17.972 --> 00:49:19.858
Take Prince Lucerys back to his dragon.

633
00:49:19.883 --> 00:49:21.843
- (thundering)
- Now.

634
00:49:21.939 --> 00:49:23.891
♪ ♪

635
00:49:33.107 --> 00:49:34.803
(Arrax roars)

636
00:49:37.127 --> 00:49:38.664
(thundering)

637
00:49:55.060 --> 00:49:55.927
(grunts)

638
00:49:56.450 --> 00:49:57.864
_

639
00:49:58.296 --> 00:49:59.754
_

640
00:49:59.843 --> 00:50:01.323
_

641
